WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.840
A book release, a screen adaptation and a co-authored novel mark three different points in Elin Hilderbrand’s publishing timeline.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.640
2014. Winter Street begins a seasonal book series.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.200
2024. Netflix releases The Perfect Couple.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.800
2025. The Academy is published with co-author Shelby Cunningham.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.360
The full chronology includes the Nantucket and Paradise books and separates books from screen adaptations.
